# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# Reacti is developed on Windows (CRLF) but built and deployed on Linux
# runners and the Hostinger VPS (LF). Without this, every commit from a
# Windows checkout shows spurious whole-file "changes" that are purely
# CRLF-vs-LF churn, drowning real diffs and risking broken shell scripts.
#
# `* text=auto eol=lf` tells git: detect text files automatically and store
# AND check them out with LF endings everywhere. Binary files are left
# untouched by the auto-detection.
* text=auto eol=lf
